<title>USA: PriceCostco Nov same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>PriceCostco Nov same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>ISSAQUAH, Wash. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $1,780     $1,610	+ 11	  + 8</p>
<p>13 weeks	  $5,250     $4,750	+ 11	  + 8</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended  Dec. 1, 1996.</p>
<p>    Full company name is			  PriceCostco Inc.</p>
